## Escalation

From-level, to-level, reason, attribution (a policy firing still names itself), ack clock, and a coded end (resolved / CANCELLED with a required reason — never deleted). "Escalated twice last quarter" is a query. DIVISION OF LABOUR with the service desk's Escalate Ticket command: that one moves a Ticket's priority; this record and the Escalate Case command own the LADDER.

```ts
import { Escalation } from '@cardstack/catalog/cards/service-desk/escalation';

@field escalation = linksTo(() => Escalation);
```

### Non-goals

No notification on raise (platform-blocked); ownership moves through Assign Owner, not here.
